blockList.listIntroduction:
 The declaration of priority within the meaning of the Paris Convention of 20 March 1883

 SR 0.232.01,0.232.02, 0.232.03,0.232.04
	 for the Protection of Industrial Property shall include the following information:

item.p:
the goods and services for which the trade mark is claimed, with an indication of the classes under the Nice Classification

 SR 0.232.112.7, 0.232.112.8,0.232.112.9
	;

by any party in accordance with the APA

 SR 172.021
	;

the Ordinance of 24 April 1929

 [BS 2 856; AS 1951 905; 1959 2100; 1962 1060; 1968 601; 1972 2444; 1977 1989;  1983 1478 No III 2; 1986 526]
	 on the Protection of Factory and Trade Marks (TmPO);
